This package bundles and depends on third-party work:

1. openWakeWord (https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord)
   Copyright (c) David Scripka. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Bundled files (unmodified, from release v0.5.1):
     models/melspectrogram.onnx
     models/embedding_model.onnx
     models/hey_jarvis_v0.1.onnx
   The audio feature pipeline implemented in this package (melspectrogram ->
   speech embedding -> keyword classifier, 80 ms / 1280-sample chunks,
   76x32 mel window, 96-dim embeddings) follows the openWakeWord design.
   The embedding model originates from Google's "speech_embedding" TF Hub
   model (Apache License 2.0).

2. Silero VAD (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad)
   Copyright (c) Silero Team. Licensed under the MIT License.
   Bundled file: models/silero_vad.onnx

3. ONNX Runtime (https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime)
